3d:["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink-500 shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-white","children":["Enforcement —"," "]}],"A three-stage Express middleware chain (authenticate → authorize → scope) that every route composes, so no controller is reachable without passing the guards."]}]]}]
